{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/4ab12c4cac02522e37ce1b460cb875de.poster.avif?t=1751481986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/4ab12c4cac02522e37ce1b460cb875de.webm?t=1751481986\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>About</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Coco's Revenge</i> is a retro inspired platformer with all the rules thrown straight out the window. <br><br>Rotate the stage. Phase between positive and negative space. <i>Coco's Revenge</i> flips the genre into something completely new. Blending spatial logic and the tried true tested methods you've come to expect from the genre, you'll be quickly asking yourself </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>&quot;Why hasn't this been done before?&quot;</strong></i> <br><br>Choose from three playable characters and take on a variety of stages across many colourful biomes, with each world adding another unique twist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on bosses, and special stages designed to test your mastery of the game, then try set the fastest times possible for every stage you come across.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/85e300631fb68f4e9cc189b934f51d98.avif?t=1751481986\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">120+ stages, including <i>Secret Stages</i> and <i>Challenges</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Biomes and Boss Battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A soundtrack featuring acoustic melodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic gameplay mechanics involving spatial awareness</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Playable Characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/440b7eb1b51df9e1345a03df4a403906.poster.avif?t=1751481986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/440b7eb1b51df9e1345a03df4a403906.mp4?t=1751481986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coco's Revenge is a game built for everyone, those new to the genre, and the experienced players looking for something fresh.<br><br>Wishlist Coco's Revenge now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3350850?t=1751481986","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/0064bf49aebe90b10377de1c2d2e6d3921fbabe6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751481986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/e3a20c05bcdab3e0f7d259e69036ea8c8d62314e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751481986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/e3a20c05bcdab3e0f7d259e69036ea8c8d62314e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751481986","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/4ab12c4cac02522e37ce1b46